It's not one we talked about in the conference room.
不是我们在会议室里讨论的那一个。

1244
00:56:21.060 --> 00:56:23.480
It's a baby coming out of his butt.
是一个从屁股里钻出来的婴儿。

1245
00:56:24.020 --> 00:56:24.540
Yes.
是的。

1246
00:56:24.980 --> 00:56:25.980
It's a butt baby.
是个屁股婴儿。

1247
00:56:26.340 --> 00:56:26.390
That's right.
没错。

1248
00:56:26.600 --> 00:56:26.880
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1249
00:56:27.760 --> 00:56:30.040
Location alert from Amber G.
来自纽约布鲁克林的安珀·G的地点提醒，她说，

1250
00:56:30.240 --> 00:56:31.740
in Brooklyn, New York, who said,
她说，

1251
00:56:31.820 --> 00:56:34.580
I recognize the tattoo parlor from another show.
我从另一部剧里认出了这家纹身店。

1252
00:56:35.220 --> 00:56:40.360
There was a show called Tattoo Nightmares on Spike TV from 2012 to 2014,
Spike TV 在 2012 年到 2014 年间播过一部叫《纹身噩梦》的节目，

1253
00:56:40.360 --> 00:56:44.860
and it was about people who got really bad tattoos and wanted them covered up
讲的是人们纹了很糟糕的纹身，想要遮盖掉，

1254
00:56:44.860 --> 00:56:46.640
with a hopefully good tattoo.
希望能换上一个好看的纹身。

1255
00:56:47.160 --> 00:56:50.980
I'm not sure about the interior, but the exterior of the building is the same.
我不确定室内是不是同一个，但建筑外观是一样的。

1256
00:56:51.180 --> 00:56:54.620
I always wondered whether it was a real tattoo parlor or not.
我一直很好奇那到底是不是一家真正的纹身店。

1257
00:56:54.780 --> 00:56:56.300
Can you give us a location breakdown?
你能给我们介绍一下拍摄地点吗？

1258
00:56:56.880 --> 00:56:59.420
Yes, Amber, this was a real tattoo parlor.
是的，Amber，那确实是一家真正的纹身店。

1259
00:56:59.600 --> 00:57:04.600
We shot at Madison Tattoo Shop on Magnolia Boulevard in North Hollywood, California.
我们是在加州北好莱坞木兰大道的麦迪逊纹身店拍摄的。

1260
00:57:04.600 --> 00:57:05.160
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1261
00:57:05.160 --> 00:57:09.900
And the actor who played our tattoo parlor employee was Jamie Jorn.
饰演我们纹身店员工的演员是 Jamie Jorn。

1262
00:57:10.560 --> 00:57:11.940
Well, Andy's going to need a minute.
好吧，Andy 需要一点时间。

1263
00:57:12.180 --> 00:57:13.280
He's going to go outside.
他要到外面去。

1264
00:57:13.400 --> 00:57:15.200
He's going to have a talk with Jim.
他要和 Jim 谈谈。

1265
00:57:15.600 --> 00:57:18.120
And he actually decides to go through with it.
而且他真的决定要这么做了。

1266
00:57:18.240 --> 00:57:19.200
He's going to do it.
他要付诸行动。

1267
00:57:19.460 --> 00:57:21.300
He says, let's ink my stink.
他说，来吧，把我的臭屁股纹上吧。

1268
00:57:21.300 --> 00:57:27.220
Yes, and he marches into the tattoo parlor and he throws off his pants down to his ankles.
没错，他大步走进纹身店，一把脱掉裤子，褪到了脚踝处。

1269
00:57:27.940 --> 00:57:29.400
His underwear as well.
内裤也脱了。

1270
00:57:29.540 --> 00:57:31.460
He's now nude from the waist down.
他现在腰部以下全裸了。

1271
00:57:31.700 --> 00:57:33.720
He dives on top of the table.
他扑到了桌子上。

1272
00:57:34.420 --> 00:57:34.800
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1273
00:57:35.280 --> 00:57:37.640
We got a lot of mail from people about this moment.
我们收到了很多观众关于这一幕的来信。

1274
00:57:38.160 --> 00:57:39.820
Jake J from Minnesota said,
来自明尼苏达州的 Jake J 说：

1275
00:57:39.820 --> 00:57:44.640
When Andy throws down his pants and jumps on the table, did Ed actually do this?
当 Andy 脱掉裤子跳上桌子时，Ed 真的是这么做的吗？

1276
00:57:45.340 --> 00:57:47.700
Jessica N from Rochester, New York said,
来自纽约州罗切斯特的 Jessica N 说：

1277
00:57:48.100 --> 00:57:53.540
Does Ed have on some kind of fleshy colored undies or something to cover his man bits?
Ed 是不是穿了某种肉色的内裤之类的东西来遮住他的私处？

1278
00:57:54.280 --> 00:57:57.840
And Anna T from Toronto, Ontario says,
来自安大略省多伦多的 Anna T 说：

1279
00:57:58.120 --> 00:58:03.120
Does Standards and Practices has a, quote, blur the lip flap for an ass?
审查部门是不是有规定，引用一下，要给屁股缝打码？

1280
00:58:03.280 --> 00:58:05.680
If so, we'd like to know.
如果是的话，我们想知道。

1281
00:58:05.680 --> 00:58:11.920
Well, Jake, yes, Ed did pull down his pants.
好吧，Jake，是的，Ed 确实脱了裤子。

1282
00:58:12.180 --> 00:58:16.680
And yes, Jessica, Ed was wearing some fleshy underwear.
还有 Jessica，是的，Ed 确实穿了肉色内裤。

1283
00:58:17.080 --> 00:58:17.600
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1284
00:58:17.940 --> 00:58:20.340
Which, let me tell you, in itself is brave.
我得说，这本身就很勇敢。

1285
00:58:20.440 --> 00:58:25.480
Because the flesh underwear are, no one wants to prance around in those.
因为那种肉色内裤，没人想穿着它到处晃悠。

1286
00:58:25.760 --> 00:58:26.120
No.
没错。

1287
00:58:26.700 --> 00:58:28.940
His shirt came down in the front.
他的衬衫前面垂了下来。

1288
00:58:29.160 --> 00:58:29.460
Yes.
是的。

1289
00:58:29.460 --> 00:58:31.760
So we didn't see any bits.
所以我们什么都没看到。

1290
00:58:32.200 --> 00:58:35.120
And Standards and Practices did have a lot to say.
审查部门确实有很多意见。

1291
00:58:35.680 --> 00:58:39.340
After we turned in the episode, they said, quote,
我们提交剧集后，他们说，引用如下：

1292
00:58:39.840 --> 00:58:47.000
Please take another pass with the pixels to make them more opaque as to obscure Andy's butt crack
请再处理一下像素，让它们更不透明一些，以遮住 Andy 的股沟，

1293
00:58:47.000 --> 00:58:53.780
in that brief moment when he pulls down his pants and lays on the tattoo parlor table in front of the office staff.
就在他脱下裤子躺在办公室员工面前的纹身店桌子上的那一瞬间。

1294
00:58:54.300 --> 00:58:56.420
So more pixels, please.
所以，请多加点像素。

1295
00:58:56.740 --> 00:58:57.780
Please, more pixels.
拜托，多加点像素。

1296
00:58:57.780 --> 00:58:59.380
As previously stated.
如前所述。

1297
00:59:00.660 --> 00:59:12.160
I want to say, I noticed a slight tonal shift in the notes from Standards and Practices when they were writing to Steve versus when they were writing to Randy.
我想说，我注意到审查部门给 Steve 写信时的语气，和给 Randy 写信时的语气有细微差别。

1298
00:59:13.000 --> 00:59:13.320
What?
什么？

1299
00:59:13.660 --> 00:59:14.260
Yes.
是的。

1300
00:59:14.420 --> 00:59:21.260
First of all, in the email, they say, Steve, we are so excited to be working with you again this season.
首先，在邮件里他们说，Steve，我们非常高兴这个季度能再次与你合作。

1301
00:59:21.700 --> 00:59:22.060
What?
什么？

1302
00:59:22.780 --> 00:59:28.040
There's also a quote where they say, if you have any questions, I can discuss with you.
还有一段话是他们说的，如果你有任何问题，我可以和你讨论。

1303
00:59:28.760 --> 00:59:33.240
Just, yes, there was no, as previously mentioned.
就是，没错，没有，正如之前提到的那样。

1304
00:59:34.100 --> 00:59:34.860
What the heck?
搞什么鬼？

1305
00:59:34.860 --> 00:59:35.680
In this correspondence.
在这封信里。

1306
00:59:35.680 --> 00:59:36.880
I don't know.
我不知道。

1307
00:59:37.100 --> 00:59:40.040
They always seemed very curt with Randy.
他们对兰迪的态度似乎一直都很生硬。

1308
00:59:40.440 --> 00:59:40.940
I know.
我知道。

1309
00:59:41.200 --> 00:59:45.420
Somehow Steve has charmed them in a way that they have a new tone.
史蒂夫不知怎么就迷住了他们，让他们换了一种语气。

1310
00:59:45.900 --> 00:59:46.940
I noticed it.
我注意到了。

1311
00:59:46.940 --> 00:59:47.980
We'll see if it continues.
我们看看这种情况会不会持续下去。

1312
00:59:48.480 --> 00:59:48.560
Huh.
嗯。

1313
00:59:49.340 --> 00:59:54.800
Well, right as they start Andy's tattoo, Pam says, we've had a slight change and hands them the new drawing.
好吧，就在他们开始给安迪纹身时，帕姆说，我们稍微改动了一下，然后把新画稿递给了他们。

1314
00:59:55.120 --> 00:59:59.680
And Andy starts to yell out, you know, and laughter slash pain.
安迪开始大叫，你知道的，那种混合着笑声和痛苦的声音。

1315
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.080
Everyone is like, oh, my gosh, this is happening.
大家都在说，天哪，这真的发生了。

1316
01:00:02.740 --> 01:00:08.320
And cutting back and forth between Andy getting his tattoo is a talking head from Robert, California.
在安迪纹身的镜头来回切换时，穿插了罗伯特·加利福尼亚的采访镜头。

1317
01:00:08.600 --> 01:00:10.400
He says, why did he choose Andy?
他说，他为什么选择安迪？

1318
01:00:10.820 --> 01:00:12.700
Because he's uncomplicated.
因为他简单直接。

1319
01:00:12.700 --> 01:00:14.740
What you see is what you get.
所见即所得。

1320
01:00:14.940 --> 01:00:18.620
And that mediocrity could also be why people fight for him.
而这种平庸可能也是人们为他争斗的原因。

1321
01:00:20.480 --> 01:00:24.580
There's something about an underdog that really inspires the unexceptional.
弱者身上总有一种特质，能真正激励那些平凡的人。

1322
01:00:26.200 --> 01:00:27.500
Such a funny line.
真是句有趣的台词。

1323
01:00:27.640 --> 01:00:28.740
It's so well written.
写得太好了。

1324
01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:32.460
Andy is going to peel off his bandage.
安迪要揭掉他的绷带了。

1325
01:00:32.640 --> 01:00:34.720
And guess what the group did?
你猜大家做了什么？

1326
01:00:35.120 --> 01:00:36.920
They got him a nard dog.
他们送了他一只“纳德狗”。

1327
01:00:37.120 --> 01:00:38.880
And it's so cute.
而且太可爱了。

1328
01:00:39.280 --> 01:00:40.600
It's his nickety name.
那是他的绰号。

1329
01:00:40.800 --> 01:00:41.580
It is.
确实是。

1330
01:00:41.580 --> 01:00:45.360
That was some amazing makeup work by Laverne and her team.
那是拉文和她的团队制作的非常棒的化妆效果。

1331
01:00:45.920 --> 01:00:47.280
Just really, really great.
真的，非常棒。

1332
01:00:47.860 --> 01:00:51.280
We got a really fun piece of fan mail about tattoos, Angela.
安吉拉，我们收到了一封关于纹身的非常有趣的粉丝来信。

1333
01:00:51.760 --> 01:00:55.360
It's from Allie B in Canton, Michigan, who says, hi, ladies.
来自密歇根州坎顿市的艾莉·B，她说，嗨，女士们。

1334
01:00:55.640 --> 01:01:02.500
I just wanted to pop on and say that this episode inspired me to have my own tattoo incentive in my sorority.
我只是想冒个泡说，这一集启发我在我的姐妹会里也搞了个纹身激励计划。

1335
01:01:03.000 --> 01:01:09.380
When I was the president of my sorority, there was this survey that our international headquarters required us to fill out every year.
当我担任姐妹会主席时，国际总部每年都要求我们填写一份调查问卷。

1336
01:01:09.380 --> 01:01:14.580
It was super long and ridiculous, but we had to have at least 85% of the chapter completed.
那份问卷超长而且很荒谬，但我们必须保证至少85%的成员完成。

1337
01:01:15.020 --> 01:01:18.340
This was something that my chapter had struggled with in the paSt.
这曾是我们分会过去一直很头疼的问题。

1338
01:01:18.400 --> 01:01:26.200
So I told them if we got 90% participation, because I'm an overachiever, I would let them pick a tattoo for me.
所以我告诉她们，如果我们能达到90%的参与率，因为我这人追求卓越，我就让她们选一个纹身纹在我身上。

1339
01:01:26.860 --> 01:01:28.820
Lo and behold, they did it.
你瞧，她们真的做到了。

1340
01:01:28.900 --> 01:01:31.040
And they were thankfully very kind with my design.
谢天谢地，她们在设计上对我还挺仁慈的。

1341
01:01:31.040 --> 01:01:36.960
It's one of my favorite tattoos I have, and it's made even better because it was inspired by an episode of The Office.
这是我最喜欢的纹身之一，而且因为它是受《办公室》某一集的启发，所以意义更特别。

1342
01:01:37.400 --> 01:01:38.520
What was the tattoo?
纹的是什么？

1343
01:01:38.960 --> 01:01:39.920
She didn't say.
她没说。

1344
01:01:41.180 --> 01:01:45.780
Just that the idea of creating a tattoo incentive was inspired by The Office.
只是说这种搞纹身激励的想法是受《办公室》启发的。

1345
01:01:46.260 --> 01:01:47.820
But I would love to know.
但我真的很想知道。

1346
01:01:47.820 --> 01:01:52.820
I am amazed by the different ways episodes of The Office inspire people.
《办公室》的剧集以各种不同的方式激励着人们，这让我感到惊讶。

1347
01:01:53.060 --> 01:01:54.260
I know, right?
可不是吗？

1348
01:01:54.620 --> 01:01:59.340
The final scene of this episode is a tag between Angela and Pam.
这一集的最后一幕是安吉拉和帕姆的彩蛋。

1349
01:01:59.720 --> 01:02:03.660
This is them going on their walk together since they're walking buddies.
这是她们一起去散步，因为她们是散步搭子。

1350
01:02:04.100 --> 01:02:08.980
Yes, I remember filming this scene, and I was quite happy to be out walking around.
是的，我记得拍摄这一幕，能出来走走我挺开心的。

1351
01:02:09.220 --> 01:02:14.760
It was a little tough for me when I was that pregnant to just like sit in an office chair all day.
我怀孕到那个程度时，整天坐在办公椅上对我来说确实有点吃力。

1352
01:02:14.760 --> 01:02:19.140
You know, your legs fall asleep, you get the sciatica, and the yada, yada, yada.
你知道，腿会发麻，还会坐骨神经痛什么的，诸如此类。

1353
01:02:19.280 --> 01:02:21.300
So I was thrilled for this storyline.
所以我对这个剧情线感到非常兴奋。

1354
01:02:21.700 --> 01:02:28.540
I noticed that they had us walk on the backside of the warehouse, which was always shady in the afternoon and had a nice breeze.
我注意到他们让我们在仓库后面走，那里下午总是阴凉，还有阵阵微风。

1355
01:02:28.760 --> 01:02:34.360
And this was the hottest time of our summer, so I bet we were very appreciative to be in the shade with the breeze.
当时正值我们夏天最热的时候，所以我敢说我们非常庆幸能待在有风的阴凉处。

1356
01:02:35.060 --> 01:02:39.440
You know, in this scene, Angela says that she's having an ethical dilemma.
你知道，在这一幕里，安吉拉说她遇到了道德困境。

1357
01:02:39.740 --> 01:02:40.220
Yeah.
是啊。

1358
01:02:40.220 --> 01:02:49.200
And she reveals that she has called social services on Pam because she has been having some herbal tea in mugs that had trace amounts of caffeine.
然后她透露说她向社会服务部门举报了帕姆，因为帕姆一直用杯子喝含有微量咖啡因的草本茶。

1359
01:02:49.620 --> 01:02:55.540
My favorite moment is, I mean, this is so ridiculous, when Pam's like, you know what, Angela, why don't you call?
我最喜欢的时刻是——我是说，这太荒谬了——当帕姆说，你知道吗，安吉拉，你为什么不打个电话举报呢？

1360
01:02:55.700 --> 01:02:56.960
And she's like, I already did.
然后她说，我已经打过了。

1361
01:02:58.380 --> 01:03:01.220
Well, we had a letter from Anna B.
嗯，我们收到了一封来自俄罗斯安娜·B的信。

1362
01:03:01.500 --> 01:03:06.820
in Russia, who had something very interesting to say about herbal tea and pregnancy.
她对草本茶和怀孕有一些非常有趣的见解。

1363
01:03:07.380 --> 01:03:15.560
Anna said, I had my baby in Finland, and the official guidelines here say that it's okay to have caffeine during pregnancy.
安娜说，我在芬兰生的孩子，这里的官方指南说怀孕期间摄入咖啡因是可以的。

1364
01:03:15.920 --> 01:03:22.080
You know, there's a certain caffeine intake, which you're not recommended to go over during the day, but one cup of coffee is okay.
你知道，每天有一个建议不要超过的咖啡因摄入量，但喝一杯咖啡是没问题的。

1365
01:03:22.080 --> 01:03:30.600
However, Angela did have a reason to report Pam because herbal tea goes against the Finnish guidelines.
不过，安吉拉举报帕姆确实有理由，因为草本茶违反了芬兰的指南。

1366
01:03:31.000 --> 01:03:33.520
You're not supposed to drink it at all while pregnant.
怀孕期间根本不应该喝它。

1367
01:03:33.860 --> 01:03:43.680
The reason is that herbal teas might contain unknown harmful elements, according to the Finnish guidelines for pregnancy care.
原因在于，根据芬兰的孕期护理指南，草本茶可能含有未知的有害成分。

1368
01:03:44.140 --> 01:03:46.900
Maybe Angela was reading up on some Finnish guidelines.
也许安吉拉当时正在研读某些芬兰指南。

1369
01:03:46.900 --> 01:03:52.320
Perhaps there was an article in that magazine that Pam never read that said something about it.
或许帕姆从未读过的那本杂志里有一篇文章提到了这件事。

1370
01:03:52.600 --> 01:03:53.160
We don't know.
我们不得而知。

1371
01:03:53.760 --> 01:03:58.720
Pam is going to suggest that maybe they just keep their pregnancies separate, not pretend to be in it together.
帕姆打算建议她们以后各自处理怀孕的事，不要假装同甘共苦。

1372
01:03:59.040 --> 01:04:02.780
And they spread apart a few paces and continue to walk side by side.
于是她们拉开了几步距离，继续并排走着。

1373
01:04:02.920 --> 01:04:03.900
But now they don't talk.
但现在她们不再说话了。

1374
01:04:04.340 --> 01:04:10.920
And I think this is why Miles was disappointed, because this storyline started and stopped all in one episode.
我想这就是迈尔斯感到失望的原因，因为这条剧情线在同一集里开始又结束了。

1375
01:04:10.920 --> 01:04:15.000
And I would have loved to have seen more of the two of them together in their pregnancies.
我本来很想看到更多关于她们两人一起怀孕的互动。

1376
01:04:15.260 --> 01:04:15.800
Me too.
我也是。

1377
01:04:15.800 --> 01:04:18.580
I just would have loved to have seen their dynamics some more.
我只是很想多看看她们之间的化学反应。

1378
01:04:18.820 --> 01:04:19.540
I agree.
我同意。

1379
01:04:19.900 --> 01:04:21.620
Well, that's it for this episode.
好了，本集内容就到这里。

1380
01:04:21.840 --> 01:04:26.580
